	(text_box "Using one chip (32MByte/ 16bit) instead of two\nThis simplifies and frees up GPIO pins\n\nH57V2562GTR-75C\n4 banks of 16Mx16\nLVTTL: 3.3V\n133MHz CAS 3\nBurst: 1,2,4,8 or fullpage\nPins: RA0 - RA12 , CA0 - CA8 , DQ0 - DQ15\n\nAddress pins:\n- SDRAM A[12:0] mapped to MPU's A[14:2]\n- A15 on SDRAM is pin40, not shown and is NC\n- A12 on MPU is not used. Pulled or NC?\n\nPower:\n- 7x VDD pins are 100nF buffered"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 22.86 0)
